<title>HONG KONG: Albatronics year net loss HK$43.44 mln.</title>
<headline>Albatronics year net loss HK$43.44 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   22.2 loss  vs 5.0 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  31.37 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    43.44 loss vs 10.05 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,118.99   vs 2,331.46</p>
<p>    Company name		 Albatronics (Far East) Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 20-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - A supplier of audio components to Sony.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs two H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
